# coiled rope (the Bubble Monkey climbs it, flag 311), both ropes up, the south mouth to
# 432,4264 (the monkey leaves for his date), down past Stonehenge to the lab (BFS route),
# Andonuts (donut No, Stonehenge Yes), the Sky Runner (Threed flight, crash: Ness and Paula
# join in the jail, Yes), the Bad key machine on the cell door, the stairs and the ladder to
